  TITLE     Molecular cloning and characterization of a novel human beta
            1,4-N-acetylgalactosaminyltransferase, beta 4GalNAc-T3, responsible
            for the synthesis of N,N'-diacetyllactosediamine, galNAc beta
            1-4GlcNAc
