COMMENT     VALIDATED REFSEQ: This record has undergone validation or
            preliminary review. The reference sequence was derived from
            AC018630.40.
            
            On or before Aug 31, 2013 this sequence version replaced
            XM_005276417.1, XM_003846799.1, NM_176884.1.
            
            Summary: TAS2R43 belongs to the large TAS2R receptor family. TAS2Rs
            are expressed on the surface of taste receptor cells and mediate
            the perception of bitterness through a G protein-coupled second
            messenger pathway (Conte et al., 2002 [PubMed 12584440]). For
            further information on TAS2Rs, see MIM 604791.[supplied by OMIM,
            Mar 2009].
            
