            preliminary review. The reference sequence was derived from
            HY028472.1, BC022535.1, AK093704.1, BX537860.1, BC037546.1,
            AL096735.1 and AW411030.1.
            
            On Nov 22, 2018 this sequence version replaced NM_198531.4.
            
            Transcript Variant: This variant (1) encodes the longer isoform
            (1).
            
            Sequence Note: This transcript is supported by overlapping EST and
            cDNA clones. The available sequence data suggest that some
            alternate splicing occurs. This record is provided so that the
            longer gene length can be represented. It is possible that this
            exact combination does not occur in vivo. The encoded protein is
            supported by mouse data.
            
